@cup_leadership

With [+ consultation_trial_cup_previous_leader +] barred from running for public office, the CUP has been forced to re-think their strategy. Changing leaderships is already part of the CUP's nature, but such a forced one was clearly unexpected. While we can expect [+ consultation_trial_cup_previous_leader +] to surely still play a role in upcoming party campaigns, will have to be [+ cup_leader +] the one to be the official presidential candidate.

